            <note corresp="#d146-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d146-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 974.7301/8–2856. Secret; Priority;
                    Limit Distribution—Suez. Drafted by Rountree; cleared, approved, and signed by
                    Dulles.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d146-f2" n="2" xml:id="d146-f2-content">
